# Renaming the inbox project keeps it the inbox: its tag stays, the Navigator lists it apart under its new name and gi still goes to it.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Call mom
END
keys <Enter> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS>
type nbox
keys <Esc> <C-g>
see │▌ 󰚇 Inbox
keys <Esc> gi
see 󰋜 › Inbox
quit
saved <<END
Inbox: @inbox
	- Call mom
END
